<title>UK: First Choice names Moir finance director.</title>
<headline>First Choice names Moir finance director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's First Choice Holidays Plc said on Monday it named Lance Moir as its group finance director, replacing David Gill, who left to join soccer club Manchester United Plc.</p>
<p>Moir, whose appointment will take effect from February 1, 1997 was formerly director of corporate finance at Bass Plc from 1991 to 1994, First Choice said in a statement.</p>
<p>He will join the board on January 6 to ensure a smooth transition, the firm said.</p>
<p>First Choice was set to report its annual results on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
